teractions on the macroscale cumulatively. It also implies unique particle interactions or behaviors that can be explained by the properties of strings and their interactions with the time surface.\n\nOverall, SAT provides a comprehensive and detailed perspective on the structure of the universe, integrating quantum mechanics and general relativity into a unified framework."
